    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re playing solo or with friends, Blessed delivers nonstop action, strategic depth, and a cosmic narrative of power, sacrifice, and survival.<br><br><strong>Customize Your Hero</strong> <br>Select your class and play with one of five cosmic stones \u2014Healing, Rage, Agility, Vision, or Armor\u2014. Each one of them is specialized for a unique play-style. Also gain new perks to be able to buy in the shop section between waves. <br><br><strong>Abilities</strong> <br>Charge aura through combat to unleash special moves \u2014support crates, bombs, turrets, \u2014 that defines your play-style. <br><br><strong>Game Loop</strong> <br>Survive endless waves of ever\u2011tougher enemies solo or co\u2011op. As you progress, the playground shifts to new arenas \u2014from elemental realms to space battlegrounds\u2014 to keep the action fresh.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re playing solo or with friends, Blessed delivers nonstop action, strategic depth, and a cosmic narrative of power, sacrifice, and survival.<br><br><strong>Customize Your Hero</strong> <br>Select your class and play with one of five cosmic stones \u2014Healing, Rage, Agility, Vision, or Armor\u2014. Each one of them is specialized for a unique play-style. Also gain new perks to be able to buy in the shop section between waves. <br><br><strong>Abilities</strong> <br>Charge aura through combat to unleash special moves \u2014support crates, bombs, turrets, \u2014 that defines your play-style. <br><br><strong>Game Loop</strong> <br>Survive endless waves of ever\u2011tougher enemies solo or co\u2011op. As you progress, the playground shifts to new arenas \u2014from elemental realms to space battlegrounds\u2014 to keep the action fresh.</p>",
    "short_description": "Blessed is a fast\u2011paced, 2D top\u2011down co-op arena shooter where you and your friends team up as &quot;blessed&quot; heroes to battle endless waves across elemental realms, and more in intense action.",
